    "sourceNotes": "The 2026–2027 teaching and examination regulations specify 150 EC of compulsory study and 30 EC of electives. Students build from introductory Dutch law and legal skills to advanced substantive law, procedure and legal research. The 6 EC moot court and 6 EC thesis are separately required. Participation in the thesis assessment requires 120 EC including Legal Skills, and moot court requires 99 EC including Legal Skills. Professional and Personal Identity and Dutch language assessment are integrated requirements.",
